                    </Text>
                    <Text
                      style={{
                        fontSize: 13,
                        fontFamily: Fonts.type.sfpRegular,
                        color: Colors.secondary,
                        width: 70,
                        textAlign: 'right',
                      }}>
                      Excl. Tax
                    </Text>
                    <Text
                      style={{
