  // row can end up with no cards at all. An empty ScrollView is 0pt tall, which
  // would pull the links and the Apply button up under the title. Reserving the
  // height of one populated card keeps the sheet's layout identical either way:
  //   50 (avatar) + 10 (name marginTop) + 34 (name minHeight)  = 94  <- card
  //   + 12 + 12 (card wrapper py) + 30 (mt) + 20 (mb)          = 168
